{"id":"f9c46ba810e9de83","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-sound-stronger-omega.md","title":"Sound Stronger than Omega Consistency","display":"prop-sound-stronger-omega — Sound Stronger than Omega Consistency","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-sound-stronger-omega","aliases":["92-prop-sound-stronger-omega"],"display":"prop-sound-stronger-omega — Sound Stronger than Omega Consistency","depends_on":["[[92-df-sound-system]]","[[92-df-omega-consistency]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-sound-stronger-omega"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-sound-stronger-omega</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-sound-stronger-omega — Sound Stronger than Omega Consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\)</span> (soundness, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (omega consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}sound\\text{-}stronger\\text{-}omega}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}sound\\text{-}stronger\\text{-}omega}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可靠性蕴含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>只证明真句子，则：\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>一致（不能证明矛盾）</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\exists x\\,\\varphi\">\\(G\\vdash\\exists x\\,\\varphi\\)</span>，则该存在句为真，故存在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>使把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>解释为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>时<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>为真</li>\n<li>因此不能对每个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>都证明闭实例<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar m,x)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar m,x)\\)</span></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>因此在元语言中有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span></li>\n<li>反向蕴涵一般不成立；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性只排除特定的numeral见证冲突，不保证全部算术定理为真</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-sound-system","status":"resolved","id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sound-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"b15ebe94f199828c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sound-system","status":"resolved","id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}(G)$ (soundness, see [[92-df-sound-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"b15ebe94f199828c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (omega consistency, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}sound\\text{-}stronger\\text{-}omega}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\exists x\\,\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\varphi,\\bar m,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1308,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["d76d3a84b374975c","b15ebe94f199828c"]}